  sequenceDiagram
      participant C as Control thread (main)
      participant P as TBB worker pool

      Note over C: timer fires every 1/30 s
      Note over C: stamp = stamp + 1
      Note over C,P: arena.execute: control thread joins the pool
      Note over P: task_group:<br/>one task per injection
      Note over P: each task moves its medicine cells<br/>(nested parallel_for)
      Note over C,P: join 1: task_group::wait
      Note over P: parallel_for<br/>over row chunks
      Note over P: rules 1 and 2, mark absorbed<br/>medicine, colour pixels
      Note over C,P: join 2: parallel_for returns
      Note over C: swap cur / next
      Note over C: glDrawPixels,<br/>update throughput
      Note over P: workers idle<br/>until the next step

